# Security & Configuration

## Input Validation & API Security
- Always validate inputs with Pydantic models
- Use header-based auth for API tokens (supports runtime override)
- Keep CORS origins restrictive but functional
- Don't leak sensitive information in error responses
- Implement rate limiting for webhook endpoints

## Configuration Management
- Support both .env files and header overrides for configuration
- Never commit API keys or tokens to version control
- Use the existing settings refresh middleware pattern
- Provide clear error messages when API keys are missing
